-- ============================================================
-- PRISM-X — complete schema bootstrap
--
-- Generated by scripts/build-schema-bundle.js from prisma/migrations.
-- 20 migrations, applied in order, plus the Prisma migration ledger.
--
-- Paste into the Supabase SQL editor and run once, against an EMPTY database.
-- Verify it is empty first:
--   select count(*) from pg_tables where schemaname = 'public';
--
-- Afterwards a normal `prisma migrate deploy` will see every migration as
-- already applied and do nothing, which is the correct outcome.
--
-- One transaction: the whole schema lands or none of it does. The RLS policies
-- are in the later migrations, so a half-applied run would leave tables with
-- no tenant isolation and no visible sign of it.
-- ============================================================

